  "post_content": "<p>El AMPA del Centro de Estudios Musicales de Onda contin&uacute;a con las actividades complementarias que organiza peri&oacute;dicamente para que ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as se familiaricen con las instalaciones de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_1123.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este s&aacute;bado, 31 de enero, han podido dirigir a instrumentistas de la banda de m&uacute;sica o ver de cerca c&oacute;mo tocaban.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1113.jpg\" alt=\"img_1113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1115.jpg\" alt=\"img_1115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1116.jpg\" alt=\"img_1116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1117.jpg\" alt=\"img_1117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1120.jpg\" alt=\"img_1120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1121.jpg\" alt=\"img_1121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1123.jpg\" alt=\"img_1123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1124.jpg\" alt=\"img_1124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1126.jpg\" alt=\"img_1126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1127.jpg\" alt=\"img_1127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1130.jpg\" alt=\"img_1130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1131.jpg\" alt=\"img_1131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1132.jpg\" alt=\"img_1132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1134.jpg\" alt=\"img_1134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1136.jpg\" alt=\"img_1136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1139.jpg\" alt=\"img_1139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1143.jpg\" alt=\"img_1143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1145.jpg\" alt=\"img_1145\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsampaconservatorionda310115/img_1148.jpg\" alt=\"img_1148\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
